# The sweep STOPPED at its first arm, by the pre-registered stop rule, so no sensitivity result exists yet.
# The cause is host-side and fully explained. REG_0's value is itself a nested protobuf message:
# "0a e0 0e" is field 1, wire type 2, length 0x760 = 1888 B, which is the REG_0 length (1891) minus its
# 3-byte header. Flipping byte 0x00 (0x0a -> 0x0b) made that header invalid, and the EP's XIR deserialiser
